<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2080] KylinInterpreter could not parse result row which is end with null value </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2080</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;KylinInterpreter use regex pattern &quot;\&quot;results\&quot;:\\[\\[\&quot;(.*?)\&quot;]]&quot; to extract the result, but if the last column is null, then no quotes in that field. Then the regex pattern will fail to match.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The KylinInterpreter should consider to support the null field case.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
